<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling falls against dollar and pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling falls against dollar and pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling fell against both the dollar and pound on Monday the central bank said.</p>
<p>Against the dollar, the shilling exchanged at a commercial mean rate of 594.4158 compared to Friday's 594.1683 and against the pound the shilling exchanged for 1001.2964 compared to Friday's 997.6992.</p>
</text>
